{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw your way through action-packed worlds as Bob, using a Magic Pencil to stop his sister Liz, who\u2019s erasing everything with a Magic Eraser. Solve puzzles, unlock secrets, and let your creativity lead the way!</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pencil is Mightier</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw platforming objects in real-time as you solve puzzles, find hidden secrets, and explore six action-packed worlds to bring peace to the Magic Sketchbook!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/3cf7242b8da6fad5594d3ad10ae6357f.poster.avif?t=1758887893\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/3cf7242b8da6fad5594d3ad10ae6357f.webm?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/3cf7242b8da6fad5594d3ad10ae6357f.mp4?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/6df9acbbf9d5e27c0db483218c773f8e.poster.avif?t=1758887893\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/6df9acbbf9d5e27c0db483218c773f8e.webm?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/6df9acbbf9d5e27c0db483218c773f8e.mp4?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tale of Two Siblings</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Bob. He\u2019s a little doodle guy who lives inside a Sketchbook. One day, Bob finds the Magic Pencil, which allows him to draw anything he can imagine! But Bob\u2019s sister Liz gets jealous of him and tries to take the pencil! What a brat! Instead, she ends up with the Magic Eraser! Liz discovers she can erase holes in the world and use them to get around faster! Upon discovering that this really upsets her big bro, Liz starts erasing more bits of the world! Now, Bob, equipped with his Magic Pencil must stop Liz from erasing the world! But is Liz really just that big of a jerk, or is there some reason behind her actions? Restore the Magic Sketchbook's erased Sketch Zones and Bob will tell the story of he and his sister and you may just learn that not everything is quite so simple...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/a724d3eb7ec644b681221a9b5aa0550f.poster.avif?t=1758887893\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/a724d3eb7ec644b681221a9b5aa0550f.webm?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/a724d3eb7ec644b681221a9b5aa0550f.mp4?t=1758887893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets of the Sketchbook</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for secret Sketch Tokens, complete levels without dying and under the object goal to unlock hidden secrets! There are over 50 costumes to unlock and each one has a unique style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick on the Draw!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in Time Trial challenges to unlock even more secrets! Try to get all of the secret Blue Stars and you'll have gone even faster than Bob's best time ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way with Modifiers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super Sketch Bob can be modified to fit any playstyle! You can slow down the game's speed, give yourself infinite health, even turn off spiders! Super Sketch Bob is designed so that anyone can play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/extras/958d00e83c32835ee7b0ada54b47e3f7.avif?t=1758887893\" width=220 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Utilize Cross/Link to unlock special items in other Wayward Thoughts Interactive games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By completing the Advanced Testing Courses in Frip and Froop's Logical Labyrinth DX, you'll be able to find a special item which can be transferred to Super Sketch Bob! What does it unlock? You'll have to play to find out!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What a Ham...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/8f22251749ea65e8c64cfcb753c29dac77dca77f.jpg"},{"name":"The Spice Must Flow...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/e5b5a38caf68bcd2e212fd3244490925007b5d57.jpg"},{"name":"Who You Gonna Call?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/29ac2db7ec46afdf89ffd189a5890ff26f8ba051.jpg"},{"name":"I am Fire! I am Death!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/3ba3d680f19dd58a9eb558d4ac4e5d715da27554.jpg"},{"name":"Super Sibling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/4321ad70049c897ca5e249012595c7a91af78cb6.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/206575a403d30a4adcb6517ff2b543833268ef7d.jpg"},{"name":"No Guts, No Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/b524840fea271b4677ad5f7d0969347f48916343.jpg"},{"name":"Silver Surfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/3c74c7dea2dd8e8c7505c95849a8480d1b6f3108.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Blur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/a2e3bf3011dd80a55c249df4f6613cd546c9e9fc.jpg"},{"name":"Race Cars, Lasers, Aeroplanes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/497870/caa3ce850748b5c4f817a2514f77ce1093161e73.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/497870?t=1758887893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/be5584d8ab01c38478d0e4261402bc9a5c81eeac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758887893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758887893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/497870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758887893","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3392170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw your way through action-packed wo